  "details": "CPU usage very high when loading worlds and Connecting/Initializing world messages displayed.\n\nAt these moments tracking not working well on Oculus Rift CV1 and opening overlay might freeze. Also SteamVR chaperone floor grid becames visible. Same behaviour on Quest Pro (SteamVR PCVR) via Steam Link.\n\nOn latest SteamVR Beta 2.9.2 it became more apparent since instead of chaperone grid it now displays black background.\n\nSeems like infinite loop running somewhere in code at these moments and not yeilding properly.\n\nThis issue not related to current build and was observed for a while, at least starting from EAC and maybe even before that.",
